{"id":"nave","lemma":"nave","pos":"noun","rank":645,"glosses":["ship, vessel (with a concave hull)","nave, aisle"],"ipa":"/ˈnabe/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"naves"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nave.wav","examples":[{"text":"La nave se hunde.","en":"The ship is sinking.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450136"},{"text":"Ellos hundieron diez naves enemigas.","en":"They sank ten enemy ships."},{"text":"Debemos abandonar la nave.","en":"We must abandon ship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506467"},{"text":"¿Crees que deberíamos abandonar la nave?","en":"Do you think we should abandon ship?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506495"},{"text":"La nave espacial hizo un aterrizaje perfecto.","en":"The spaceship made a perfect landing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689167"}]}